  "prefLabel": "Eng 101.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-09-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eng 101.01 Purpose and Scope. The rules of this title implement the statutory responsibilities of the New Hampshire board of professional engineers created by RSA 310-A: 3. These provisions regulate but are not limited to the licensing of professional engineers and the practice of professional engineering in the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Eng 100) #5397, eff 5-20-92; ss by #6752, Interim, eff 5-20-98, EXPIRED: 9-17-98\n\nNew. #6910, eff 12-15-98",
